  "solution": "**Symbol**\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n\nAfter replacing the symbols by their meaning, we get:\n\n(**11** - 5 __**+ 18**__) ÷ 8 × 17\n\n= __**(29 - 5)**__ ÷ 8 × 17\n\n= __**24 **____**÷**____** 8**__ × 17\n\n= **__3 __****__× 17__**\n\n= 51\n\nHence, '**51**' is the correct answer.",
